#: flowview_filters.php
msgid "Materialization pre-computes the results of a Filter for each flow partition, with NAT on and off, and stores them in the Parallel Query cache, so reports over older data open quickly.  New partitions are materialized automatically once they stop receiving flows.  Required means partitions that have rotated are not materialized yet, Running means a materialization is in progress, and Up to date means every rotated partition is materialized.  Running: N is how many queries of the Filter are working now.  The partition still receiving flows is not materialized, so it does not count."
msgstr "Itegura mbere ribanza kubara ibisubizo by'Akayunguruzo kuri buri gice cy'imigendekere y'amakuru, igihe NAT ifunguye n'igihe ifunze, rikabibika mu bubiko bwihuse bwa Parallel Query kugira ngo raporo ku makuru ya kera zifunguke vuba. Ibice bishya bitegurwa mbere ku buryo bwikora iyo bihagaritse kwakira imigendekere y'amakuru. Bisabwa bisobanura ko ibice byahinduwe bitarategurwa mbere, Birimo gukora bisobanura ko itegura mbere riri gukorwa, naho Byavuguruwe bisobanura ko buri gice cyahinduwe cyateguwe mbere. Birimo gukora: N ni umubare w'ibibazo by'Akayunguruzo biri gukora ubu. Igice kikiri kwakira imigendekere y'amakuru ntigitegurwa mbere, bityo nticyibarwa."

