#: setup.php
msgid "Choose how parallel FlowView queries are executed.  The Legacy PHP Runner forks the flowview_runner.php process per query and shard.  The FlowView Query Service dispatches the same map-reduce work to a long-running Go service over localhost, avoiding per-query process startup and database polling latency.  Requires the flowview-query service (see plugins/flowview/service/flowview-query) to be installed and running."
msgstr "Hitamo uko ibibazo bya FlowView bikorera icyarimwe bitunganywa. Legacy PHP Runner itangiza igikorwa cya flowview_runner.php kuri buri kibazo na buri gice. Serivisi y'Ibibazo ya FlowView yohereza uwo murimo umwe wa map-reduce kuri serivisi ya Go ikora igihe kirekire binyuze kuri localhost, bikirinda gutangiza igikorwa kuri buri kibazo n'itinda ryo gukusanya mu bubiko bw'amakuru. Bisaba ko serivisi ya flowview-query (reba plugins/flowview/service/flowview-query) iba yarashyizweho kandi irimo gukora."

#: setup.php
msgid "Legacy PHP Runner"
msgstr "Ikoresha rya kera rya PHP"

#: setup.php
msgid "FlowView Query Service"
msgstr "Serivisi y'ishakisha ya FlowView"

#: setup.php
msgid "Query Service URL"
msgstr "URL ya Serivisi y'Ububazo"

#: setup.php
msgid "Base URL of the FlowView Query Service, for example http://127.0.0.1:8699.  Leave blank to auto-discover the ephemeral port from the service's port file."
msgstr "URL shingiro ya Serivisi y'Ibibazo ya FlowView, urugero http://127.0.0.1:8699. Siga harimo ubusa kugira ngo ishakishe mu buryo bwikora icyambu cy'igihe gito mu idosiye y'ibyambu bya serivisi."

#: setup.php
msgid "Query Service Port File"
msgstr "Idosiye y'icyambu cya Serivisi y'Ububazo"

#: setup.php
msgid "Path to the port file the FlowView Query Service writes its bound address to.  Used to discover the service endpoint when the Query Service URL above is blank."
msgstr "Inzira igana kuri dosiye y'umuyoboro aho Serivisi y'Ibazamakuru ya FlowView yandika aderesi yayo.  Ikoreshwa mu gushakisha aho serivisi ikorera igihe URL ya Serivisi y'Ibazamakuru iri hejuru iri ubusa."

#: setup.php
msgid "Query Service Token"
msgstr "Ikimenyetso cya Serivisi y'Ububazo"

#: setup.php
msgid "Optional shared secret.  When set, Cacti sends it to the FlowView Query Service as an \"Authorization: Bearer\" header and the service rejects any state-changing request that does not present the same token.  Set the matching value in the service's config file (auth_token) or the FLOWVIEW_QUERY_TOKEN environment variable.  Recommended whenever the service is reachable by anything other than trusted local processes."
msgstr "Ibanga risangiwe ritari ngombwa.  Iyo rishyizweho, Cacti iryohereza kuri Serivisi y'Ibaza rya FlowView nk'umutwe wa \"Authorization: Bearer\" maze serivisi ikanga ubusabe bwose buhindura imiterere buterekanye ikimenyetso kimwe.  Shyira agaciro gahura mu idosiye y'igenamiterere ya serivisi (auth_token) cyangwa mu gihinduka cy'ibidukikije cya FLOWVIEW_QUERY_TOKEN.  Birasabwa igihe cyose serivisi ishobora kugerwaho n'ikindi kintu kitari porogaramu z'aho zizewe."

#: setup.php
msgid "Max Concurrent Threads"
msgstr "Imirongo y'ibikorwa ikorera rimwe ntarengwa"

#: setup.php
msgid "The maximum number of threads that will be dispatched to run the FlowView queries.  Note that you can have at most 1 thread per database partition, and you should be careful not to overload your database server with having too many concurrent threads running."
msgstr "Umubare ntarengwa w'imirongo y'ibikorwa (threads) izoherezwa gukora ibibazo by'ishakisha bya FlowView. Menya ko ushobora kugira igipimo cyo hejuru cy'umurongo 1 kuri buri gice cy'ububiko bw'amakuru, kandi ugomba kwitonda ntugirengo uremereze seriveri y'ububiko bw'amakuru yawe ukoresha imirongo y'ibikorwa myinshi ikorera icyarimwe."

