msgid "MaxScale Sharding"
msgstr "Igabanyabubiko rya MaxScale"

#: setup.php
msgid "This is only required if your Cacti System's Flowview Database connection is not already using a MaxScale enabled Read-Write Split port."
msgstr "Ibi bikenewe gusa niba ihuza ry'Ububiko bw'amakuru bwa Flowview bwa Sisitemu yawe ya Cacti ritarakoresha icyambu cya Read-Write Split gifite MaxScale."

#: setup.php
msgid "Leverage MaxScale to Distribute Query Shards"
msgstr "Koresha MaxScale mu gukwirakwiza ibice by'ubusabe"

#: setup.php
msgid "If you have multiple service acting as slaves for MaxScale, you can increase the speed of querying by distributing the parallel queries to multiple MariaDB backend servers."
msgstr "Niba ufite serivisi nyinshi zikora nk'izikurikira kuri MaxScale, ushobora kongera umuvuduko wo gushakisha amakuru ukwirakwiza ibibazo bikorera rimwe kuri seriveri nyinshi za MariaDB ziri inyuma."

